<span id="A4.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prompt for Anaphore agreement at short distance with ’cat’ and ’cats’</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:4.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="62.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59.42)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Using the nouns ’cat’ and ’cats’, please write a minimal pair of sentences that shows a short distance usage of reflexive pronouns. The pronouns must be placed close to the subjects ’cat’ and ’cats’. Please use the past tense. Now please do the same with ’cat’ and ’cats’. You must encapsulate the two sentences together in between brackets.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="145.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 145.02" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,145.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFFF;" fill="#BFBFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 139.12 C 0 142.38 2.64 145.02 5.91 145.02 L 647.24 145.02 C 650.51 145.02 653.15 142.38 653.15 139.12 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 120.91 L 651.18 120.91 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 129.51)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
